{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:350797932c8630b5","name":"Urban Navigator Speeder Bike","source":{"id":"source:reference-350797932c8630b5","title":"Urban Navigator Speeder Bike","revision":19366,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T21:49:23Z","sha256":"9f38ff47e2bc15a85b872ee20664eebc4a2ed240b38164221f28d2b401028c8c","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=19366","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Urban%20Navigator%20Speeder%20Bike&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-350797932c8630b5","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Knights of the Old Republic Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Knights_of_the_Old_Republic_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The rise in popularity of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bikes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bikes"}," in the run-up to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Great Sith War"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Great_Sith_War"}," allows ",{"tag":"a","children":["Lhosan Industries"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Lhosan_Industries","referenceId":"reference:243f88645fb81a36"}," to dominate the light repulsorlift market. Though other companies try to produce bikes to rival Lhosan's, only one company achieves anywhere near the same level of success. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Aratech Corporation"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Aratech_Corporation?action=edit&redlink=1"}," designs its Urban Navigator Speeder Bike specifically for use in large cities and encumenopolises such as ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Taris"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Taris","referenceId":"reference:6c77edc098cd2a27"},". Moreover, the Urban Navigator is one of the few ",{"tag":"a","children":["Speeder Bikes"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Speeder_Bikes"}," to accommodate a passenger. Its sidecar makes it ideal for those who need quick and nimble transportation and have friends, coworkers, or spouses to travel with. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["The Urban Navigator is an excellent source of transportation over short distances. It is a fast Speeder Bike, though it cannot compare to the Lhosan ",{"tag":"a","children":["AeroChaser Speeder Bike"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/AeroChaser_Speeder_Bike","referenceId":"reference:99a1108b55bc9000"}," for maximum velocity. The addition of the Vehicle's sidecar reduces its maneuverability, but the Speeder Bike is also capable of operating at the higher altitudes of Urban Airspeeder lanes, making it a versatile transport for getting anywhere in a city. \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["The Old Republic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Old_Republic","referenceId":"reference:6517b7e15507b001"}," purchases a large quantity of Urban Navigators for use during wartime. The Speeder Bikes prove to be an excellent choice for officers and their aides when traveling the skyways of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Coruscant"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Coruscant","referenceId":"reference:2ee37a21e9e7a955"}," and other heavily developed worlds. They also allow politicians to move quickly from one place to another while accompanied by their bodyguards.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Normal)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Urban Navigator Speeder Bike Statistics (CL 1)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large ",{"tag":"a","children":["Airspeeder"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Airspeeder"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"h